  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 0
  Text: "The boy saw nothing. \r\n\r\"Leave the register alone?My boss would kill
    me!\" \r\n\rBut he heard it all. \r\n\rAround 4 AM there were some weird mooing
    sounds, \u201CI thought maybe some <link>special cow</link> escaped or something,
    but then there were this loud screeching, and <link>something BIG</link> like
    mostly big crashed.\" \n\"I don't know what I heard later... it sounded like
    people, animals, cars, everything all at once, like a slow explosion. And then
    <link>something got on the roof</link>.\" \n\"You guys seem to know... How screwed
    are we?\" \nHe is the one who called the news, and he's very excited about appearing
    on TV. \r"
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
